SUMMARY:COMING MEMORIAL DAY WEEKEND | Umphrey’s McGee
DESCRIPTION:Friday\, May 22nd & Saturday\, May 23rd\, 2026 | Pisgah Brewing Outdoor Stage | Doors open at 6:00PM\, music starts at 7:30PM \nFriday\, May 22nd Event Details and Tickets \nSaturday\, May 23rd Event Details and Tickets \nWith over 2\,800 live shows\, 15 studio albums\, and more than 27 years of musical evolution\, Umphrey’s McGee continues to defy classification and expectation. Drawing fans from around the globe and across musical boundaries\, the band has cultivated a devoted community rooted in spontaneity\, precision\, and connection. \nPioneers at the intersection of music and technology\, their live experience fuses cutting-edge production with fan-centric innovation\, creating a space where longtime followers and newcomers alike feel at home. Genre lines blur as progressive rock\, funk\, jazz\, metal\, electronic\, and beyond converge into something unmistakably Umphrey’s.\n\nMore than just a band\, Umphrey’s McGee is a living\, breathing organism — constantly evolving\, yet grounded in a singular mission: to create bold\, immersive\, and memorable musical experiences. \n  \nFounded in 2005\, Pisgah is known for producing some of the most sought after craft ales in Western North Carolina. Pisgah Brewing Company currently operates the new indoor taproom & deli\, with live music several days a week\, plus an open air outdoor bar in the summer and fall months. Check out our upcoming schedule at pisgahbrewing.com/events
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/coming-memorial-day-weekend-umphreys-mcgee-2/2026-05-17/
LOCATION:Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain\, 2948 US-70\, Black Mountain\, NC\, 28711
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Black Mountain,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/627480039_1368427411978098_970304923746143494_n-e1770315646754.jpg
GEO:35.6068069;-82.3568213
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=Pisgah Brewing Company Black Mountain 2948 US-70 Black Mountain NC 28711;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=2948 US-70:geo:-82.3568213,35.6068069
END:VEVENT
