SUMMARY:The JLloyd Monday Mashup: w/sg Melissa McKinney\, Jamie Hendrickson & Tyler Housholder!
DESCRIPTION:Melissa McKinney on vocals\, Jamie Hendrickson on guitar (Electrolust/Auspicious Golden Fish) and Tyler Housholder on percussion (The Broadcast).\nWe have quite a mix of music for this one guaranteed to keep ya groovin’!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nEvent starts at 8.Music starts at 8:30.Going until 11:15ish.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n$10. Thank you for the continued support!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nMashup Mondays every Monday at One World Brewing West with special guests and different music every week!!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThe JLloyd MashUp explores different genres of music including Acid Jazz\, Funk\, Soul\, Afro Beat\, Reggae\, Break Beat\, and Latin. Led and curated by Jonathan Lloyd (The Fritz/Dubconscious/Cadillac Jones)\, the band is made up of some of Asheville’s busiest and hardest working musicians on the scene.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/jloyd-mashup-mondays-w-sg/
LOCATION:One World Brewing – West\, 520 Haywood Rd\, Asheville\, North Carolina\, 28806
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/IMG_5305-e1779068059422.jpeg
GEO:35.5783642;-82.5848526
