SUMMARY:Acoustic Tuesday w/ Peter Townsend
DESCRIPTION:Peter Townsend is a road-tested guitarist\, mandolin player\, and solo musician blending Americana\, bluegrass\, and rock ’n’ roll into a dynamic\, roots-driven sound. Originally from Wisconsin\, he began his musical journey in Alaska in the late ’90s with The Photonz\, a jam band known for its energetic mix of bluegrass and rock. Now performing with Laron Huntley & The Gravely Brothers\, Peter brings a soulful\, expressive style shaped by years on the road and a deep love of live music.
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/acoustic-tuesday-w-pete-townsend/2026-05-19/
LOCATION:Village Pub Biltmore Village
CATEGORIES:Asheville Area,Live Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://livemusicasheville.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/11/IMG_7578-scaled-e1773661991752.jpeg
END:VEVENT
